# Explorer's Cache: "Whenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, put a +1/+1 counter on this artifact." Bot1 moves
# both of the Cache's counters, one per turn, onto two Ornithopters, leaving the Cache with none, then casts Wrath of God on turn 3. The
# two Ornithopters die together, each with a +1/+1 counter as it last was on the battlefield (CR 603.10a), and the trigger happens once
# for each (CR 603.2c): the Cache, which is no creature and stays, ends with two counters.

